OL,3,GNEWSAConvicted murderer jailed for
OL,4,Aassault on father
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man convicted of murdering his
OL,7,Fmillionaire fiancee in France has been
OL,8,Fjailed for a "degrading" attack on his
OL,9,Felderly father.
OL,11,FIan Griffin, 57, was living in the
OL,12,Fsummerhouse of his parent's home in
OL,13,FWinwick, Warrington, when police were
OL,14,Fcalled and found his father Bernard
OL,15,FGriffin with serious facial injuries,
OL,16,FLiverpool Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
