OL,3,GNEWSAConvicted murderer jailed for
OL,4,Aassault on father
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn May 2009, he had been sentenced to
OL,7,F20 years in Paris for killing Kinga
OL,8,FLegg, whose battered body was found in
OL,9,Ftheir room at the Bristol Hotel, but
OL,10,Fwas released in 2016 after serving 22
OL,11,Fmonths following an appeal on medical
OL,12,Fgrounds.
OL,14,FThe 57-year-old has been jailed for
OL,15,Ffive years for causing grievous bodily
OL,16,Fharm and threatening to damage
OL,17,Fproperty.
